<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-08-13T02:04:34+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Thu, 13 Aug 2026 02:04:34 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Quote by Voltaire: 'Life is a shipwreck, but we must not forget to sing in the lifeboats']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133192730.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Life often throws insurmountable challenges our way, yet how we respond is within our control. A saying mistakenly linked to Voltaire beautifully encapsulates this spirit of resilience. This notion complements Viktor Frankl's concept of tragic optimism, proposing that we can find joy amid adversity. Embracing radical acceptance allows us to confront our circumstances, paving the way to discover meaning and happiness even in the darkest times.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-inspired-by-voltaire-life-is-a-shipwreck-but-we-must-not-forget-to-sing-in-the-lifeboats-and-why-choosing-joy-in-the-face-of-chaos-may-be-the-ultimate-act-of-defiance/articleshow/133192730.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-inspired-by-voltaire-life-is-a-shipwreck-but-we-must-not-forget-to-sing-in-the-lifeboats-and-why-choosing-joy-in-the-face-of-chaos-may-be-the-ultimate-act-of-defiance/articleshow/133192730.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T02:00:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133192881,imgsize-1023937.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Zohran Mamdani: 'For generation after generation, we have been told that when the world has sent its people to our shores, it has not sent its best']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133192786.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-zohran-mamdani-for-generation-after-generation-we-have-been-told-that-when-the-world-has-sent-its-people-to-our-shores-it-has-not-sent-its-best/articleshow/133192786.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-zohran-mamdani-for-generation-after-generation-we-have-been-told-that-when-the-world-has-sent-its-people-to-our-shores-it-has-not-sent-its-best/articleshow/133192786.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T01:33:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133192801,imgsize-707024.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote by Montesquieu: 'Success of most things depends upon knowing how long it will take to succeed']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133192668.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Jeff Bezos led Amazon by prioritizing a long-term vision rather than chasing short-term gains. This perspective aligns with Montesquieu's philosophy that success is often a lengthy journey. Misjudging project timeframes can lead to distress and hasty strategy changes. Insights from modern behavioral science highlight the planning fallacy and sunk cost biases. To excel in any domain, it is crucial to accurately grasp how long true mastery takes.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-by-montesquieu-the-success-of-most-things-depends-upon-knowing-how-long-it-will-take-to-succeed-and-why-we-give-up-on-our-biggest-goals-too-soon/articleshow/133192668.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-by-montesquieu-the-success-of-most-things-depends-upon-knowing-how-long-it-will-take-to-succeed-and-why-we-give-up-on-our-biggest-goals-too-soon/articleshow/133192668.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T01:20:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133192711,imgsize-852378.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Hardcore World Not Deleted: Viral clip sparks panic; IShowSpeed confirms save is safe]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133192461.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Jamal did delete a Minecraft world from IShowSpeed’s computer, but it was not the Hardcore save shared by Speed and Kai Cenat. Speed later checked the clip and confirmed their active world, “i got a bad b boat,” was safe. The duo is continuing their second Minecraft challenge, with the Warden next and 42 deaths already recorded so far today.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/was-jamal-really-behind-the-deletion-of-ishowspeed-and-kai-cenats-minecraft-hardcore-world-viral-clip-explained/articleshow/133192461.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/was-jamal-really-behind-the-deletion-of-ishowspeed-and-kai-cenats-minecraft-hardcore-world-viral-clip-explained/articleshow/133192461.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T00:53:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133192461,imgsize-70742.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by David Goggins: 'You are in danger of living a life so comfortable and soft, that you will die without ever realizing your true potential' and why ease is not the answer]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133191681.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-david-goggins-you-are-in-danger-of-living-a-life-so-comfortable-and-soft-that-you-will-die-without-ever-realizing-your-true-potential-and-why-ease-is-not-the-answer/articleshow/133191681.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-david-goggins-you-are-in-danger-of-living-a-life-so-comfortable-and-soft-that-you-will-die-without-ever-realizing-your-true-potential-and-why-ease-is-not-the-answer/articleshow/133191681.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T00:29:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133192207,imgsize-150258.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A $13.5 million Maryland project turned dredged sand, silt and shell into roughly 70 acres]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133190048.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In an impressive $13.5 million initiative, 70 acres of tidal wetland habitat have been established. By reusing dredged river sediment, a previously eroding marsh area was restored, benefiting local wildlife and commercial shipping activities alike. The introduction of native salt marsh grasses has fortified this new terrain, enhancing its stability. As a result, Maryland's shoreline and diverse wildlife now enjoy enhanced protection and habitat restoration.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-13-5-million-maryland-project-turned-dredged-sand-silt-and-shell-into-roughly-70-acres-of-wetland-habitat-for-threatened-marsh-birds/articleshow/133190048.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-13-5-million-maryland-project-turned-dredged-sand-silt-and-shell-into-roughly-70-acres-of-wetland-habitat-for-threatened-marsh-birds/articleshow/133190048.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T23:41:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133190877,imgsize-901451.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Marco Rubio jokes he would ask Donald Trump to bomb Paraguay if he goes on a keto diet: 'Just because I haven't had any sugar']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133190692.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/marco-rubio-jokes-he-would-ask-donald-trump-to-bomb-paraguay-if-he-goes-on-a-keto-diet-just-because-i-havent-had-any-sugar/articleshow/133190692.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/marco-rubio-jokes-he-would-ask-donald-trump-to-bomb-paraguay-if-he-goes-on-a-keto-diet-just-because-i-havent-had-any-sugar/articleshow/133190692.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T23:34:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133190725,imgsize-80084.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Florida completed a 2,560-acre stormwater treatment landscape with 4,750 acre-feet of storage]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133187046.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A groundbreaking environmental restoration initiative in South Florida has marked a pivotal achievement with the completion of the Indian River Lagoon-South C-23/C-24 Stormwater Treatment Area. Designed to effectively capture and purify contaminated runoff before it can harm coastal ecosystems, this facility represents a crucial advancement in the Comprehensive Everglades Restoration Plan and aims to enhance the health of essential estuaries and water quality overall.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-completed-a-2560-acre-stormwater-treatment-landscape-with-4750-acre-feet-of-storage-to-help-protect-the-indian-river-lagoon/articleshow/133187046.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-completed-a-2560-acre-stormwater-treatment-landscape-with-4750-acre-feet-of-storage-to-help-protect-the-indian-river-lagoon/articleshow/133187046.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T23:17:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133187636,imgsize-1676052.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[After 23 years, US to pull out last troops from Iraq by September 30]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hs