]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-1998-nasa-sent-a-rose-into-space-and-discovered-that-microgravity-could-change-its-scent/articleshow/133183735.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-1998-nasa-sent-a-rose-into-space-and-discovered-that-microgravity-could-change-its-scent/articleshow/133183735.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T19:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133183970,imgsize-144800.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Clavicular’s ‘I Can Fix Her’ Post: streamer hits on Ocasio-Cortez; congresswoman stays silent]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133186573.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Clavicular has reacted to reports about Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez’s split from Riley Roberts with a short message: “I can fix her.” The breakup was reportedly not recent and may have happened around two years ago. The comment comes after Ocasio-Cortez and Clavicular previously disagreed over looksmaxxing and its message to young men. She has not publicly responded to Clavicular so far.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/why-is-clavicular-targeting-alexandria-ocasio-cortez-after-riley-roberts-split-their-looksmaxxing-history-adds-another-twist/articleshow/133186573.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/why-is-clavicular-targeting-alexandria-ocasio-cortez-after-riley-roberts-split-their-looksmaxxing-history-adds-another-twist/articleshow/133186573.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T20:37:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133186573,imgsize-39415.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Dan Scavino, Natalie Harp, Walt Nauta: 3 aides were allowed with Trump when he wasmoved into a catering truck during Turkey emergency]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133186616.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/dan-scavino-natalie-harp-walt-nauta-3-aides-were-allowed-with-trump-when-he-wasmoved-into-a-catering-truck-during-turkey-emergency/articleshow/133186616.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/dan-scavino-natalie-harp-walt-nauta-3-aides-were-allowed-with-trump-when-he-wasmoved-into-a-catering-truck-during-turkey-emergency/articleshow/133186616.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T20:40:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133186632,imgsize-101384.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Florida's 23-acre Bannon Island, held by one family for roughly 150 years and reachable only by boat]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133184351.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Nestled near Haines City, Florida, Bannon Island—a coveted private island—has hit the market after remaining in one family for four generations. The residence skillfully marries aged 19th-century cypress wood with contemporary glass elements. With additional buildings and lush landscapes, the potential for creative development is endless. It offers the perfect balance of tranquility and accessibility, keeping Orlando and Tampa just a short distance away.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/floridas-23-acre-bannon-island-held-by-one-family-for-roughly-150-years-and-reachable-only-by-boat-helicopter-or-seaplane-is-listed-for-12-million/articleshow/133184351.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/floridas-23-acre-bannon-island-held-by-one-family-for-roughly-150-years-and-reachable-only-by-boat-helicopter-or-seaplane-is-listed-for-12-million/articleshow/133184351.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T20:32:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133186544,imgsize-1432155.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Minnesota funded $1.918 million for Shell Rock River habitat; 588 acres protected or restored by 2025]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133185961.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Shell Rock River Watershed initiative in Minnesota has made significant strides by securing 588 acres of critical habitat, surpassing its original objective by 105 acres through extensive restoration work. This program focused on acquiring various properties while bolstering wetlands and prairie habitats. Backed by funding for land purchases and aquatic enhancements, these projects are vital for the future of Minnesota's fish and wildlife.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2020-minnesota-funded-a-1-918-million-shell-rock-river-habitat-program-by-2025-it-had-protected-or-restored-588-acres/articleshow/133185961.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2020-minnesota-funded-a-1-918-million-shell-rock-river-habitat-program-by-2025-it-had-protected-or-restored-588-acres/articleshow/133185961.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T20:22:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133186128,imgsize-785088.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[20-year-old tourist dies in US after falling from 170-feet waterfall while posing for photos]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133186737.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/20-year-old-tourist-dies-in-us-after-falling-from-170-feet-waterfall-while-posing-for-photos/articleshow/133186737.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/20-year-old-tourist-dies-in-us-after-falling-from-170-feet-waterfall-while-posing-for-photos/articleshow/133186737.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T20:51:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133186820,imgsize-1348457.cms"/></item></channel></rss>